    "body": "## Scope\r\n\r\nRuns one isolated Ubuntu 24.04 package-signature diagnostic job for the fixed 37-archive experimental shared-key provider inventory. No application deployment, dependency integration, Azure credentials, OIDC, trust changes or production approval.\r\n\r\n## Verification\r\n\r\nLocally executed: 16 downloader and 18 verifier mocked safety tests, 10 independent mocked hostile cases, YAML/shell/Python syntax and static permissions/action/upload controls, exact seven-file export and secret checks. These are preparation checks. Actual Linux signature/platform evidence remains pending this run and independent receipt review.\r\n\r\nManifest SHA256: `8ed2ffab1478d381cf310b62e7c6b198bf47595e8e7100c16d2738fc6a4fee42`. SDK: `10.0.401`. Normal TLS/revocation/package trust; all 37 original archive hashes and direct verifier exits must match. Diagnostic receipts/logs only are uploaded under the existing repository retention default.\r\n\r\nThis draft PR contains only the reviewed proof workflow, manifest, downloader/verifier safety tooling and self-contained proof contract. No merge or release is requested.\r\n",
